WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.800
Your work already holds the answers.
Pitchroom brings them into one clear conversation.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.433
Add a website, a presentation, or a guide.
Review each source before your assistant uses it.

00:00:12.633 --> 00:00:18.433
Ask a question by voice or text.
Follow up naturally, without searching through files.

00:00:18.633 --> 00:00:25.800
Every answer links to its page, slide, or section.
Open the evidence and check the original context.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:32.733
If your material doesn't answer, Pitchroom says so.
It stays inside approved sources instead of guessing.

00:00:32.933 --> 00:00:38.833
Use the same simple flow for a team handbook,
a course, a service guide, or a project.

00:00:39.033 --> 00:00:49.033
Keep your assistant private as you build. Publish an approved snapshot
when it's ready, and revoke its link any time. Pitchroom. Bring your knowledge into the room.
